[node name="StoryItems" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="FeverRecords" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-410, -330)
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the fever books"
flag_to_set = "abbey_fever_records_read"
discovery_text = "[b]The fever books[/b]

Brother Anselm's shelf of the Grey Fever, twenty years old and carefully kept: the dead by parish, the bells rung, the remedies tried and failed. The last book records the one that worked: fever-root, steeped long, with a pinch of white salt 'from the deep vein at Greystone, and from nowhere else.' In a younger Anselm's hand: 'The salt is the cure. The root alone is only comfort.'

The newest page is from this spring: 'Two drovers from the western valley, grey at the lips. It begins again.'"
reexamine_text = "Fever-root and Greystone salt. And this spring: 'It begins again.'"

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="StoryItems/FeverRecords"]
shape = SubResource("RectangleShape2D_90x76")

[node name="Visual" type="ColorRect" parent="StoryItems/FeverRecords"]
