[node name="PurchasersRoll" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-260, -70)
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look behind the fever books"
flag_to_set = "abbey_ashdown_record_found"
discovery_text = "[b]A purchasers' roll[/b]

Tucked behind the fever books is a roll of who bought Greystone salt in the fever years, and at what price. One house bought nearly all of it, early, and sold it on to the Cathedral and the city at ten times the cost.

House Ashdown.

The roll carries the abbey's seal. It has never been copied."
reexamine_text = "House Ashdown bought the cure, and sold it at ten times the price."

