[node name="CopyDesk" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(540, -150)
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the copy desk"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A half-finished copy[/b]

A novice has been copying a herbal, page by careful page. The chapter on fever-root stops mid-sentence, and the pen lies across it. Someone told them to stop."
reexamine_text = "The fever-root chapter is still unfinished."

