[node name="AnselmShelfIndex" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-410, -110)
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read Anselm's shelf index"
flag_to_set = ""
puzzle_id = "abbey_receipt"
discovery_text = "[b]Brother Anselm's index[/b]

A quire bound in slate-grey boards, chained to the end of the shelves, in a small square hand: every book the abbey keeps, by shelf and place.

Shelf I: psalters and the offices of the hours.
Shelf II: herbals. II.4, the herbal under copy; fever-root at leaf thirty-one.
Shelf III: the Grey Fever, one book to a year, from III.1, the first year, to III.7, the last. In each, the receipts tried that year are bound in at the twelfth leaf.
Shelf IV: the chronicles of the house.
The saints' days and the other dull books are kept below, in the undercroft."
reexamine_text = "Anselm's index: shelf, book and leaf for everything the abbey keeps. The fever books on shelf III, a year to a book, their receipts at the twelfth leaf."

